# Skills for {{ package_name }}

Agent skills for this project live here, following the `.agents/skills/` cross-tool convention.
`.claude/skills` is a symlink to this directory — Claude Code doesn't read `.agents/skills/`
natively yet, only the symlink target — so a skill placed here is picked up by both.

No skills are installed by default. Add one as a subdirectory here (or symlink one in from
elsewhere) and it's live for Claude Code immediately, no separate registration step.
